### 1번 상품의 리뷰 — 첫 페이지
# @name first
GET http://localhost:4001/api/products/1/reviews?limit=3

### 둘째 페이지
# @name second
GET http://localhost:4001/api/products/1/reviews?limit=3&cursor={{first.nextCursor}}

### 셋째 페이지
GET http://localhost:4001/api/products/1/reviews?limit=3&cursor={{second.nextCursor}}

### 커서가 아닌 값
GET http://localhost:4001/api/products/1/reviews?limit=3&cursor=abc
